Third-party components

UNI2-h (MahmoodLab) is downloaded separately by the user under its own licence, which
restricts commercial use and requires accepting the model card's terms.
voice/_se2_arch.py and voice/_nb_head.py contain the SE(2)-equivariant decoder and the
negative-binomial head contributed by Yicheng Tao as part of this work.

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers this repository's own source code. It does not cover
the UNI2-h weights, which remain subject to the terms above.
